</font></b></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>| </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uswords/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>스워드</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uthrowing/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>던지는 \n                무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> |</b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/uwands/\"><b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>완드</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><b><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Elite \nUniques</font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"> </font></b><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>: </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euweapons/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>무기</b></font></a><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b> | </b></font><a href=\"/site/Diablo/euarmor/\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>아머</b></font></a></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolordark=\"#CCCCCC\" bordercolorlight=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"7\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"580\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F8F8F8\" colspan=\"3\" height=\"30\" width=\"562\">\n<p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><a href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20020130222331/http://forg.co.kr:80/Diablo/sets7.shtml#sandersfolly\" target=\"_blank\"><font color=\"#996600\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;</b></font></a><font color=\"olive\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><b>Exceptional Unique Bow \n                             \n                            </b></font><font color=\"#333333\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>[익셉셔널 유니크 활]</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"black\" width=\"97\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><img height=\"118\" src=\"/img/posts/site/Diablo/images/item/unique/pluckeye.gif\" width=\"62\">\n</span></font></p><center>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#908858\"><span><b>Skystrike</b></span></font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"white\" face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\">Edge Bow</font></p></center></td>\n<td bgcolor=\"white\" width=\"219\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>Two-Hand Damage: <font color=\"#4850b8\">(17.5-21) </font></span></font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span><font color=\"#4850b8\">To (50-60)</font> (33.75-40.5 Avg)<br>Required Level: \n28<br>Required Strength: 25<br>Required Dexterity: 43<br>Base Weapon Speed: \n[5]<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+150-200% Enhanced Damage</font>(varies)<br><font color=\"#4850b8\">Adds 1-250 Lightning Damage</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">2% \nChance To Cast Level 6 Meteor On Striking</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">30% \nIncreased Attack Rate</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+100 To Attack \nRating</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+1 To Amazon Skill Levels</font><br><font color=\"#4850b8\">+10 to Energy</font><br>(Only Spawns In Patch 1.09 or later) \n</span></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"214\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움,helvetica\" size=\"2\"><span>양손데미지 \n                            : <font color=\"#4850b8\">(17.5-21) To (50-60)</font> (33.75-40.5 Avg)<br>레벨 요구치 : \n28<br>힘 요구치 : 25